  data: {
    LLM: "Identify your 'Chain'. If you are missing the highest Matador (e.g., you have 3 Jacks but not the Clubs), you are 'Against 1'. This significantly changes how you bid.\n\nThe Lead Trap: If you hold several Matadors, lead them consecutively. This consumes your opponents' trumps while you maintain the lead, eventually leaving your middle-cards as the highest on the table.\n\nBidding Risk: Bid high when you have many Matadors, as the multiplier ensures a massive score. However, if you are 'Against' many Matadors, your point-capture must be near perfect to win.",
    Player: "Identify your 'Chain'. If you are missing the highest Matador (e.g., you have 3 Jacks but not the Clubs), you are 'Against 1'. This significantly changes how you bid.\n\nThe Lead Trap: If you hold several Matadors, lead them consecutively. This consumes your opponents' trumps while you maintain the lead, eventually leaving your middle-cards as the highest on the table.\n\nBidding Risk: Bid high when you have many Matadors, as the multiplier ensures a massive score. However, if you are 'Against' many Matadors, your point-capture must be near perfect to win.",
